{"duration": 28.92, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.1, "text": "Then, on the third of May, came the\nbig female from the start of this"}, {"start": 4.1, "end": 8.8, "text": "story. She lay on Franskraal beach.\nBiologist Alison Towner and her"}, {"start": 8.8, "end": 14.02, "text": "team from the Dyer Island Conservation\nTrust measured her at 4.9 metres,"}, {"start": 14.02, "end": 19.05, "text": "about 16 feet. They put her\nweight at 1,110 kilograms."}, {"start": 19.75, "end": 24.97, "text": "No larger great white had ever been\ndissected in South Africa. Boat crews"}, {"start": 24.97, "end": 28.92, "text": "had last logged her alive at Dyer\nIsland almost a year earlier."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.38, "text": "Then,"}, {"start": 0.7, "end": 0.88, "text": "on"}, {"start": 0.88, "end": 0.98, "text": "the"}, {"start": 0.98, "end": 1.3, "text": "third"}, {"start": 1.3, "end": 1.4, "text": "of"}, {"start": 1.4, "end": 1.76, "text": "May,"}, {"start": 2.16, "end": 2.36, "text": "came"}, {"start": 2.36, "end": 2.52, "text": "the"}, {"start": 2.52, "end": 2.76, "text": "big"}, {"start": 2.76, "end": 3.16, "text": "female"}, {"start": 3.16, "end": 3.42, "text": "from"}, {"start": 3.42, "end": 3.58, "text": "the"}, {"start": 3.58, "end": 3.78, "text": "start"}, {"start": 3.78, "end": 3.94, "text": "of"}, {"start": 3.94, "end": 4.1, "text": "this"}, {"start": 4.1, "end": 4.48, "text": "story."}, {"start": 4.9, "end": 5.02, "text": "She"}, {"start": 5.02, "end": 5.22, "text": "lay"}, {"start": 5.22, "end": 5.46, "text": "on"}, {"start": 5.46, "end": 6.22, "text": "Franskraal"}, {"start": 6.22, "end": 6.4, "text": "beach."}, {"start": 7.22, "end": 7.62, "text": "Biologist"}, {"start": 7.62, "end": 8.08, "text": "Alison"}, {"start": 8.08, "end": 8.58, "text": "Towner"}, {"start": 8.58, "end": 8.7, "text": "and"}, {"start": 8.7, "end": 8.8, "text": "her"}, {"start": 8.8, "end": 9.1, "text": "team"}, {"start": 9.1, "end": 9.34, "text": "from"}, {"start": 9.34, "end":